# Chi Game
a offline first game platform
online functionalities will be added 
xo connect 4 backgommon uno and etc...

# Stack
frontend with js (ts) + vue framework

managing users, statistics, data, chat .... in **golang** (protobuf + rpc)
game logic in **ts**

## Prepare

### protobuf + rpc
note: not a good idea to install globaly but ...
```bash
npm install -g @connectrpc/protoc-gen-connect-query
npm install -g @bufbuild/protoc-gen-es

```